# Build context exclusions for `docker build -f docforge/Dockerfile … src`.
# Anything matched here is NEVER sent to the daemon, so the build sees a clean tree.

# ── Frontend dev artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `npm install` runs inside the frontend dev container against the bind-mounted
# source tree, so node_modules + Vite dist appear on the host. They contain
# symlinks under .bin/ that BuildKit refuses ("invalid file request") and they
# would also bust the layer cache on every install.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite

# ── Python build/runtime artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/.venv
**/venv

# ── Editor / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# ── Logs / local data ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/logs
**/*.log
